{"book":"numbers","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T20:29:06.218101954Z","verse":10,"ref":"numbers 10:10","tier":"bulk","chapter":10,"translation":"And in the day of your gladness and in your appointed times and in ⟨the⟩ beginnings of your new moons you shall blow ⟨the⟩ trumpets over your burnt-offerings and over ⟨the⟩ sacrifices of your peace-offerings and they shall be to you for a remembrance before your Elohim I ⟨am⟩ YHWH your Elohim.","tokens":[{"surface":"וביום","gloss":"And in the day"},{"surface":"שמחתכם","gloss":"of your gladness"},{"surface":"ובמועדיכם","gloss":"and in your appointed times"},{"surface":"ובראשי","gloss":"and in ⟨the⟩ beginnings"},{"surface":"חדשיכם","gloss":"of your new moons"},{"surface":"ותקעתם","gloss":"you shall blow"},{"surface":"בחצצרת","gloss":"⟨the⟩ trumpets"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"over"},{"surface":"עלתיכם","gloss":"your burnt-offerings"},{"surface":"ועל","gloss":"and over"},{"surface":"זבחי","gloss":"⟨the⟩ sacrifices"},{"surface":"שלמיכם","gloss":"of your peace-offerings"},{"surface":"והיו","gloss":"and they shall be"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"לזכרון","gloss":"for a remembrance"},{"surface":"לפני","gloss":"before"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"your Elohim"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"your Elohim"}]}